{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01102",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.76,
      "end_seconds": 2.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "evening let's get started"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.42,
      "end_seconds": 6.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Well, afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.02,
      "end_seconds": 11.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "thank you for fitting us in, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.84,
      "end_seconds": 15.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 17.77,
      "end_seconds": 21.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "We came because of pain in that calf."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.15,
      "end_seconds": 25.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.14,
      "end_seconds": 35.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "Hmm, I'd say ten days. Actually, no, closer to two days. Mm, there's heaviness in the leg as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.48,
      "end_seconds": 39.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "how troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.35,
      "end_seconds": 48.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.48,
      "text": "I'd call it severe. And there's a bit of redness as well about a week now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.76,
      "end_seconds": 55.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Have you had pain in that calf before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.51,
      "end_seconds": 64.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.67,
      "text": "um, a bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.3,
      "end_seconds": 74.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "let me check a a few things. Any chest pain, coughing up blood or recent injury to the leg?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.97,
      "end_seconds": 82.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.67,
      "text": "I haven't had chest pain, coughing up blood or recent injury to the leg, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.69,
      "end_seconds": 86.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Any sign of fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.73,
      "end_seconds": 89.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No. No fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 90.33,
      "end_seconds": 94.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "actually, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.54,
      "end_seconds": 102.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "no I don't think I did. Maybe a little I'm not sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.52,
      "end_seconds": 110.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Alright I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.08,
      "end_seconds": 112.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "no changes there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.05,
      "end_seconds": 115.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 117.17,
      "end_seconds": 132.35,
      "duration_seconds": 15.18,
      "text": "She takes diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed. She takes losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure. She is on paracetamol, 500 milligrams, when needed, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.83,
      "end_seconds": 136.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "hm okay have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.97,
      "end_seconds": 153.41,
      "duration_seconds": 12.44,
      "text": "hmm there was some antibiotic I was told I was allergic but I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.56,
      "end_seconds": 166.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.61,
      "end_seconds": 172.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.05,
      "end_seconds": 176.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "and alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.59,
      "end_seconds": 179.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.84,
      "end_seconds": 184.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.27,
      "end_seconds": 187.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.64,
      "end_seconds": 192.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.73,
      "end_seconds": 198.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.48,
      "end_seconds": 201.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.77,
      "end_seconds": 205.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.89,
      "end_seconds": 209.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.5,
      "end_seconds": 225.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.92,
      "text": "I've got arthritis in my knees. I've never really been one for hospitals. I've had high blood pressure for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.26,
      "end_seconds": 235.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "right, so arthritis in your knees is already on your record we'll keep that in mind today anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.18,
      "end_seconds": 241.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "just a meniscus repair on my knee four years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.93,
      "end_seconds": 245.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "let me take your readings now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.74,
      "end_seconds": 260.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.27,
      "end_seconds": 286.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "okay: temp 36.5 degrees, BP is 127 over 79, heart rate 126, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.19,
      "end_seconds": 290.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.54,
      "end_seconds": 309.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.87,
      "end_seconds": 314.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "stay as you are for a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.83,
      "end_seconds": 325.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "the right leg looks normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.22,
      "end_seconds": 328.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "let me feel here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.87,
      "end_seconds": 342.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "the left calf is bigger than the the right tender along the vein"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.07,
      "end_seconds": 344.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.52,
      "end_seconds": 359.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.9,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Taking everything into account, I'd lean towards a possible deep vein clot. It could also be cellulitis, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.16,
      "end_seconds": 362.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.93,
      "end_seconds": 371.87,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible deep vein clot is my leading thought, not anything worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.47,
      "end_seconds": 397.07,
      "duration_seconds": 15.6,
      "text": "I want a D-dimer blood test done, that's for suspected DVT i'm going to order a Doppler scan of the leg, for suspected DVT keep walking gently, and don't massage the calf i'll want another look after the scan"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.9,
      "end_seconds": 399.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "I can manage that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.53,
      "end_seconds": 404.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 406.15,
      "end_seconds": 408.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}